@startuml View List Canteens Sequence Diagram
title UC-CG01 - View List Canteens

actor "Admin" as User
participant "Canteen\nGovernance Page" as Frontend
participant ":canteenRoutes" as Routes
participant ":canteenController" as Controller
participant ":canteenService" as Service
participant "Canteen\nModel" as Model
database "MongoDB" as DB

User -> Frontend: 1. Open Canteen Governance page
Frontend -> Routes: 2. GET /api/canteens?status=...&campusId=...

note over Routes
This endpoint is public.
No authentication middleware required.
end note

Routes -> Controller: 3. getAllCanteens(req, res)
Controller -> Service: 4. getAllCanteens(query)

Service -> Service: 5. Build filter from query
Service -> Model: 6. find(filter).populate("campusId", "name code").sort({ createdAt: -1 })
Model -> DB: 7. Query canteens by filter
DB --> Model: 8. Canteen list
Model --> Service: 9. Canteens

Service --> Controller: 10. Canteens result
Controller --> Routes: 11. HTTP 200
Routes --> Frontend: 12. JSON response\n{ status, results, data: { canteens } }

Frontend -> Frontend: 13. Render table/tabs for canteens
Frontend --> User: 14. Display canteen list

@enduml
